<main class="pc" data-product-depth="technology"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / Technology</p><h1>Technology makes hidden relationships visible.</h1><p class="pc-lead">Explore interactive models, technology concepts and directions for collaboration.</p><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-feature"><p class="pc-kicker">Interactive project · integration concept</p><h2>VITA WELLNESS × CRANIO</h2><h3>Spine Bilateral Mapping</h3><p>Bilateral spine map: left and right indicators, asymmetry, longitudinal change and engineering specifications.</p><svg class="pc-tech-figure" viewBox="0 0 500 240" role="img" aria-label="L/R illustrative bilateral architecture"><g stroke="currentColor" opacity=".22" fill="none"><path d="M250 12V228"/><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="100"/><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="78"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.42"><rect x="218" y="25" width="24" height="12" rx="3"/><rect x="258" y="25" width="42" height="12" rx="3"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.475"><rect x="200" y="47" width="42" height="12" rx="3"/><rect x="258" y="47" width="60" height="12" rx="3"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.53"><rect x="182" y="69" width="60" height="12" rx="3"/><rect x="258" y="69" width="24" height="12" rx="3"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.585"><rect x="218" y="91" width="24" height="12" rx="3"/><rect x="258" y="91" width="42" height="12" rx="3"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.64"><rect x="200" y="113" width="42" height="12" rx="3"/><rect x="258" y="113" width="60" height="12" rx="3"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.6950000000000001"><rect x="182" y="135" width="60" height="12" rx="3"/><rect x="258" y="135" width="24" height="12" rx="3"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.75"><rect x="218" y="157" width="24" height="12" rx="3"/><rect x="258" y="157" width="42" height="12" rx="3"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="var(--pa)" opacity="0.804999999999999